{{ template "header" .}}
<div class="d-flex justify-content-between align-items-center pb-2 mb-3 border-bottom"><h1 class="h2">管理员账户安全</h1></div>
<div class="card"><div class="card-body">{{if .Other.Required}}<div class="alert alert-info">管理员必须启用双重验证。完成设置前，其他后台功能不可用。</div>{{end}}{{if .Other.Disabled}}<div class="alert alert-success">双重验证已停用，所有会话已撤销。</div>{{end}}{{with .Other.Enrollment}}<div class="alert alert-warning"><p>请将密钥添加到身份验证器，再输入当前六位验证码。密钥只显示一次。</p><p><strong>设置密钥：</strong> <code>{{.Secret}}</code></p><p><strong>TOTP 地址：</strong> <code>{{.URI}}</code></p></div><form method="post" action="security">{{$.Other.CSRFInput}}<input type="hidden" name="action" value="confirm"><label for="security-confirm-code">六位验证码</label><input id="security-confirm-code" class="form-control" name="totp" pattern="[0-9]{6}" required><button class="btn btn-primary mt-2" type="submit">确认并启用</button></form>{{end}}{{with .Other.RecoveryCodes}}<div class="alert alert-success"><p><strong>立即离线保存以下单次使用恢复代码：</strong></p><ul>{{range .}}<li><code>{{.}}</code></li>{{end}}</ul></div>{{end}}<p>当前状态：<strong>{{.Other.MFAState}}</strong>；未使用恢复代码：<strong>{{.Other.RecoveryRemaining}}</strong></p>{{if eq .Other.MFAState "Disabled"}}<form method="post" action="security">{{.Other.CSRFInput}}<input type="hidden" name="action" value="enroll"><button class="btn btn-primary" type="submit">设置身份验证器</button></form>{{end}}{{if eq .Other.MFAState "Enabled"}}<hr><form method="post" action="security">{{.Other.CSRFInput}}<input type="hidden" name="action" value="rotateRecovery"><label for="security-rotate-code">当前六位验证码</label><input id="security-rotate-code" class="form-control" name="totp" pattern="[0-9]{6}" required><button class="btn btn-secondary mt-2" type="submit">更新恢复代码</button></form><hr><form method="post" action="security">{{.Other.CSRFInput}}<input type="hidden" name="action" value="disable"><label for="security-disable-code">当前六位验证码</label><input id="security-disable-code" class="form-control" name="totp" pattern="[0-9]{6}" required><label for="security-disable-reason">操作原因</label><input id="security-disable-reason" class="form-control" name="reason" maxlength="255" required><button class="btn btn-danger mt-2" type="submit">停用并撤销全部会话</button></form>{{end}}</div></div>{{ template "footer" .}}
